diff --git a/RetreatUI/CHANGELOG.txt b/RetreatUI/CHANGELOG.txt
index f567f2f..3aa32f3 100644
--- a/RetreatUI/CHANGELOG.txt
+++ b/RetreatUI/CHANGELOG.txt
@@ -1,3 +1,15 @@
+RetreatUI v1.0.11-beta.4
+============================
+
+WITCH DOCTOR — VOODOO TRACKING TEST
+- Added Hex of Malice / Zalazane's Malice target-debuff tracking.
+- Corrected Puppeteer's Threads to track on the target rather than as a player proc.
+- Added a dedicated Loa state icon with live stack count.
+- Added Drakkari Barrier cooldown and active-duration tracking.
+- Added learned-only Voodoo Strings, Shadowflare and Voodoo Idol coverage.
+- Added learned-only Healing Ward and Cleansing Idol utility coverage.
+- Candidate aura aliases only appear when the live client reports a matching spell or aura.
+
 RetreatUI v1.0.11-beta.3
 - Target-frame debuff tracking now shows every debuff applied by the player, pet, or vehicle across all classes.
 - Added safer handling for Ascension class debuffs that do not report a caster.
